arted), 10 events that are currently in progress, and 27 events that have already been completed.\n\nSo, to answer your question directly: you don't really have any courses or events that are pending. Instead, you have a mix of those that haven't started yet, are currently in progress, and those that have already been finished.\n", timestamp=1754065080.3438778, metadata={'timestamp': 1754065080.34261, 'used_history_messages': 6, 'is_anonymous': False, 'response_length': 802})]

Respond with only: USER_PROFILE_INFO, USER_PROFILE_UPDATE, CERTIFICATE_ISSUES, TICKET_CREATION, or GENERAL_SUPPORT


